        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 9,
        "ActionId": 9,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Forget it. There are more important matters.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Since you led your team while conducting the space station operation...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 11,
        "ActionId": 11,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "After evaluating the threat of such an operation, the Science Council has decided to implement a new safety measure to avoid a similar situation from happening again.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 12,
        "ActionId": 12,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "My research team has developed a combat simulator for emulating ideal combat scenarios based on the environmental data and team data collected thus far.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 13,
        "ActionId": 13,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "I've named it \"Project Babel Tower\".",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 14,
        "ActionId": 14,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "I believe you've already participated in the first phase of the experiment.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "As far as the combat data report is concerned, I'm grateful for the contributions from each team involved.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "But as I've already made myself clear, this plan will be a long-term measure.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Based on the previous combat report, I've made some minor enhancements and adjustments to the device.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 18,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Also, I've integrated some environmental elements from the recent desert region.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "As always, give it everything you got so Command has more useful combat data to analyze and reference.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 20,
        "ActionId": 20,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Got it.",
            21,
            "Are we getting paid?",
            22
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 21,
        "ActionId": 21,
        "NextActionId": 23,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Providing combat data for more difficult scenarios will be beneficial for each squad going forward.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Asimov",
            "Looks like someone needs to learn a thing or two about manners. That being said, Command will provide you with supplies.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
